        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ConvertOut-Resized-A.Shimus_04252025_11_of_23_1_7afc0e3a-fb83-419b-b9b5-fbe018ec3ade.jpg",
        "layout": "left",
        "title": "Our Story",
        "text": "<p>A.SHIMUS creates modern workwear designed specifically for petite women. Fit and proportion are considered from the very beginning, so each piece feels balanced, intentional, and easy to wear… without the need for adjustments.</p><p>Our work is shaped by Japanese craftsmanship and a deep respect for how clothing is made. We collaborate closely with skilled artisans and small manufacturers in Japan, working carefully through fabric selection, tailoring, and construction. The result is clothing defined by quality, restraint, and attention to detail, rather than trend.</p><p>We design workwear to be practical and versatile. Clean silhouettes, thoughtful tailoring, and pieces that move comfortably through the day, from meetings and travel to everything that follows.</p><p>At its heart, A.SHIMUS exists to make getting dressed easier for women building their careers. By focusing on fit, craftsmanship, and purpose, we create garments designed to feel reliable, considered, and quietly confident - just like the women who wear them.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "",
        "buttons_style": "filled",
        "override_button_colors": false,
