    "image_with_text_YD3Yxk": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_4922.heic",
        "layout": "right",
        "title": "A Note from the Founder",
        "text": "<p>A.SHIMUS was born from personal experience. As a petite woman working in professional environments, I spent years searching for clothing that felt appropriate, confident, and truly well-fitting, without needing alterations. Too often, workwear designed for smaller frames was an afterthought, forcing women to adjust themselves to the clothing rather than the other way around.</p><p>I started A.SHIMUS to change that.</p><p>From the beginning, my goal was to design garments specifically for petite women in business; pieces that feel intentional, balanced, and empowering. Fit is never secondary here, it’s the foundation. Every pattern, proportion, and detail is designed with care, so our clothing supports how women move, work, and show up each day.</p><p>Japanese craftsmanship has long inspired me for its respect for process, precision, and longevity. By partnering with skilled artisans and manufacturers in Japan, A.SHIMUS honors this tradition, creating clothing that is thoughtfully made, responsibly produced, and designed to endure beyond seasons.</p><p>A.SHIMUS is deeply personal, but it is built for a community. It exists to support women who are building careers, leading teams, and defining success on their own terms. My hope is that when you wear A.SHIMUS, you feel confident, capable, and entirely yourself.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "",
        "buttons_style": "filled",
        "override_button_colors": false,
        "button_background_color": "#e68819",
        "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
        "section-width": "content",
        "section_padding_top": 70,
        "section_padding_bottom": 70,
        "colors": "white"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_zxJF9e": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-bnwtake0405-19630352.jpg",
        "layout": "left",
        "title": "Japanese Standard Sizing",
        "text": "<p>To perfect the silhouettes of our garments, they’re developed according to Japanese sizing, known for its precise tailoring and alignment with smaller frames.<br/><br/>More specifically, our size S corresponds to a Japanese 9AR, a carefully chosen reference that reflects the proportions of petite women.<br/><br/>While certain measurements – such as sleeve length and bust –<br/>are slightly more compact than the standard US sizing,<br/>A.SHIMUS garments are thoughtfully designed to enhance and flatter.<br/><br/>Additionally, most of our bottoms feature adjustable waistbands for added comfort.<br/>Please refer to our size chart for more details.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "",
        "buttons_style": "filled",
        "override_button_colors": false,
